<title>UK: Ldn gold, other precious metals end off highs.</title>
<headline>Ldn gold, other precious metals end off highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Ends up $2.80 at $342.60/$343.30 but below $344.00 touched in early afternoon. Hard resistance just above $345.00. Busang news prompts short covering, but pressured at highs.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finishes two cents up at $4.74/$4.76, also off highs.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up $1.50 at $373.00/$374.00. Rangebound.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Slips after initial gains. Down $2.25 at $155.75/$156.25.</p>
</text>
